Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:52:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rogue finishers wait for combo points (F-219)

- combat tracks SMSG_UPDATE_COMBO_POINTS (target, points)
- Ability min_combo: a finisher needs that many points on the target, or any
  once it is about to die (< 4 s) or we are losing
- rogue: Eviscerate first at 3 points, then Sinister Strike (Eviscerate on a
  10 s timer failed NO_COMBO_POINTS 45x a run)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
